    <string name="about_text">AMARadio is 100% ad-free and privacy-focused.\n\nI originally developed this app for my mother to provide her with a simple, honest radio experience without annoying ads or tracking. This is why AMARadio will always remain free of advertisements – it\'s a promise to her, shared with all of you.\n\nThis project is a fork of the excellent https://github.com/segler-alex/RadioDroid . The entire codebase has been migrated from Java to Kotlin to ensure the app stays modern and compatible with future Android versions.\n\nThe source code is available at: https://github.com/ounben/AMARadio\n\nThis app uses the free radio station directory at https://www.radio-browser.info .\nEveryone can add stations to it. It works like a wiki for online radio stations.\n\nContact: ben@ounben.com\n\nBugtracker: https://github.com/ounben/AMARadio/issues\n\nIf you like the software and want to help, feel free to send me an email.\nAlso ideas for new features are always appreciated!\n\nThis app is free software, licensed under the GPLv3. https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html</string>
